  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN-AU partnership in conflict prevention, mediation and PSOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Project is to enhance the UN-AU partnership in the area of conflict prevention and mediation. The Project will support operational and analytical UN-AU efforts to prevent conflict in Africa. The objectives are: 1) Further develop a common understanding of conflicts in Africa between the UN and the AU, 2) Support UN-AU mediation efforts and AU&#x2019;s mediation capacity, and 3) Strengthen UN Security Council &#x2013; AU Peace and Security Council relations.</narrative>
  </description>
